  "$comment": "Every text-on-surface pair the CI contrast test evaluates on resolved permutations (ADR-0011). tier: functional = 4.5:1 (3:1 at >= 24 px), decorative = 3:1 and only allowed at >= 24 px, boundary = 3:1 for UI component edges. Expected values come from docs/research/visual-dna.md (appendix) and are re-checked by tools/contrast, not trusted.",
